  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance and Resilience Programme ( HARP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the G7 Famine Prevention Compact, Nigeria&#x2019;s Humanitarian and Resilience Programme (HARP) will provide life-saving support to the most vulnerable and strengthen resilience, opening pathways to livelihoods. HARP will enhance overall effectiveness of the UN-led humanitarian response, including a focus on building Nigerian ownership.</narrative>
  </description>
